<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Absa says secures $120 mln overseas offer.</title>
<headline>Absa says secures $120 mln overseas offer.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African bank ABSA Ltd said on Tuesday that it had successfully concluded an international issue of $120 million worth of ordinary shares and Global Depositary Receipts.</p>
<p>The bank said it also had an over-allotment option for up to an additional $18 million.</p>
</text>
